    thinking: "**Constructing Essential Utilities**\n\nI\'m now structuring `/src/lib/utils.ts`. This file will be the home for crucial utility functions. I\'m focusing on `cn` for class name merging using `clsx` and `twMerge`. I am adding platform detection and URL normalization. Further, I am considering a mock affiliate link generator for development, and functions to estimate price and cashback.\n\n\n**Adding Platform-Specific Logic**\n\nI\'m now integrating currency formatting, copy-to-clipboard, and QR code download helpers. I\'m also delving into platform-specific URL handling, particularly for Shopee and TikTok Shop. My current focus is on standardizing URL normalization and mock affiliate link generation for each platform to ensure compatibility and accuracy across various domains. I\'m extracting item and shop IDs, removing extraneous tracking parameters, and creating clean URLs.\n\n\n"
