  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Application Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the application\'s foundational components. I\'ve started building `Header.tsx`, including the navbar with the Cashback Link logo, platform badges, a theme switcher for light/dark/system modes, and a stats summary. Next, I\'m moving on to `UrlConverter.tsx`, which will feature a URL input field with clear and paste-from-clipboard buttons, paying close attention to handling clipboard permissions gracefully.\n\n\n**Developing Conversion Workflow**\n\nI\'m now integrating the core conversion workflow. I\'ve defined the components for real-time platform badge indicators and sample URLs. I\'m prioritizing user customization of SubID/Tag, and then working on the \"Convert to Cashback Link\" button, along with the normalization preview. I\'m also now building the `ConversionResult` component to showcase the converted link and rich product details, while adding action buttons and a promo snippet builder. Finally, I\'m building a QR code modal with interactive rendering.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 10
      nanos: 156280565
    }
