  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying All Requirements**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the initial compilation ran flawlessly on the first attempt! Now, I\'m meticulously cross-referencing all of the user\'s requirements from the prompt to guarantee complete coverage. The core aspects of the MVP web application, \"Cashback Link\", including the app title, metadata, header, and branding, are now in place. I\'m moving toward the conversion of the product URLs.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built the **Cashback Link** application.\n\n### Key Implementation Highlights:\n\n- **E-Commerce Platform Detection**: Real-time identification for **Shopee**, **TikTok Shop**, and **Lazada** URLs as users paste or type, displaying custom brand color badges and active commission tiers.\n- **URL Normalization & Affiliate Link Engine**: Automatically strips tracking noise (`spm`, `utm_*`, `_t`, `click_id`, `exlaz`) and appends affiliate tracking IDs along with customizable campaign **SubIDs** (`user_id`, `telegram_deals`, `tiktok_bio`).\n- **One-Click Actions**:\n  - **Copy Link**: 1-click clipboard copy with instant visual confirmation for shortened links, raw links, and promotional text snippets.\n  - **Open Link**: Safe external link opening with standard security attributes.\n  - **QR Code Generator**: Interactive QR Code modal rendered using `qrcode.react` with canvas rendering, customizable color palettes, logo overlay, and direct **PNG image download**.\n- **Bulk Link Converter**: Allows converting multiple Shopee, TikTok, and Lazada URLs at once in a multi-line batch interface with 1-click bulk export/copy.\n- **History & CSV Export**: Automatically persists converted links to `localStorage` with search filtering by product title/SubID, platform filter chips, total cashback calculation, and CSV export.\n- **Commission Rates Calculator**: Reference table and interactive cashback simulator estimating earnings across product categories (Fashion, Beauty, Electronics, Home).\n- **Dark Mode Support**: Light, Dark, and System theme toggle with responsive mobile-first typography and high-contrast styling."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 310407423
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
