  planner_response {
    modified_response: "The **Professional Polish** design theme has been applied across the entire **Cashback Link** application.\n\n### Design & Aesthetic Updates\n\n- **Zinc Palette & Deep Charcoal Canvas**: Replaced generic gray tones with a refined `zinc` palette (`zinc-50` light canvas, `zinc-950` dark mode background, `zinc-800` borders) for higher visual contrast and depth.\n- **Electric Blue Primary Accents**: Shifted primary call-to-action buttons, active navigation states, badges, and link highlights to electric blue (`blue-600` / `blue-500`) with subtle glow borders.\n- **Ambient Lighting Effects**: Enhanced the main layout in `App.tsx` with multi-layered radial gradients and backdrop blurs to create a sleek backdrop in both light and dark modes.\n- **Refined Control Cards**: Updated `UrlConverter`, `ConversionResult`, `HistoryList`, `BatchConverter`, `RatesGuide`, and `QrCodeModal` with modern 2xl-rounded container borders, polished action buttons, crisp typography, and high-visibility status badges.\n- **Consistent Platform Badges**: Preserved brand-recognized platform colors (Shopee Orange, TikTok Teal, Lazada Blue) with soft semi-transparent pill badges across all components."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
